  "translate_en|mods/PhunZones2/common/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_PhunZones_StaffExempt": "Staff ignore zone restrictions",
  "translate_en|mods/PhunZones2/common/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_PhunZones_StaffExempt_tooltip": "When on, staff are not blocked by a zone's No Building, No Placing, No Pickup, No Scrapping, No Destruction, No Safehouse or No Players settings. By itself this covers the Admin role only - tick 'Include Moderator and GM' to widen it. No Fire and safe zones are never exempted: neither check has a player to let through.",
